          The best banana protein powder for most people is Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard 100% Whey in Banana Cream, because it gives about 24 g of protein per scoop at one of the lowest costs per gram of any brand-name whey. It is banana-flavored rather than made with banana, so if you want real fruit on the label, Truvani's Banana Cinnamon is the pick. And for the best-tasting banana shake, blend unflavored whey with a real frozen banana.
