              </table>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p>
            All figures come from labels or listings at the time of writing and can change with reformulations, so check the panel on the tub you receive. Banana flavors in particular come and go: brands trim slower-selling flavors, and a banana listing can quietly switch to a different formula or disappear. We cover what that means for Amazon buyers further down.
