          <p>
            These six are ranked on banana source, protein per serving, sweeteners and colors, value and Amazon availability, from labels and listings at the time of writing rather than our own taste tests. Five are banana-flavored or banana-containing powders and one is an unflavored whey for real-banana shakes. Figures vary by tub size and label revision.
          </p>

          {PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => (
            <ProductCard product={product} rank={index + 1} />
          ))}
